  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Dispositivos:** *smartphone (UK: mobile phone) · laptop · tablet · charger · headphones*.",
      "",
      "**Acciones comunes**",
      "",
      "- *download / upload* (descargar / subir) · *log in / log out* (entrar / salir de una cuenta) · *sign up* (registrarse)",
      "- *click on* · *search for* · *delete* · *save* · *turn on / turn off* · *connect to the Wi-Fi*",
      "",
      "**Problemas típicos y cómo decirlos**",
      "",
      "- *My battery is dead / flat.* · *My phone has run out of battery.*",
      "- *I can't connect to the Wi-Fi.* · *The screen is frozen.* · *I forgot my password.*",
      "- *Could you help me? I can't log in.*",
      "",
      "**Ojo, falso amigo:** *app* es la aplicación del móvil; *application* en inglés suele ser una **solicitud** (*a job application*).",
      "",
      "**Ojo con las preposiciones:** *log in **to** an account · connect **to** Wi-Fi · search **for** something · click **on** a link*.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *battery* /ˈbætəri/ · *password* /ˈpɑːswɜːd/ · *download* /ˌdaʊnˈləʊd/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I need to log to the website.",
        "right": "I need to log in to the website.",
        "note": "Falta in: log in to."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "My phone is without battery.",
        "right": "My phone has no battery.",
        "note": "Sin batería = has no battery / is out of battery."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": [
      {
        "word": "application",
        "es_false": "aplicación (del móvil)",
        "real": "solicitud",
        "note": "La aplicación del móvil es app."
      }
    ]
  },
